# Playwright
apps/web/playwright-report/
apps/web/test-results/

# Visual-golden baselines (ADR-032 Net 2) come from Linux CI — see
# .github/workflows/goldens.yml. Playwright suffixes snapshots per platform,
# so a Windows or macOS baseline can never satisfy CI and would only add
# noise; ignore local ones so they cannot be committed by accident. Linux
# baselines (…-linux.png) are deliberately NOT ignored: they are the gate.
apps/web/e2e-golden/**/*-win32.png
apps/web/e2e-golden/**/*-darwin.png
